      | email            | password   | name      |
      | user@example.com | SecureP@ss | Test User |
    When I login with email "nobody@example.com" and password "SecureP@ss" # steps/auth_steps.py:205
    Then the response status should be 401                                 # steps/common_steps.py:63
    And the response should contain error "Invalid credentials"            # steps/common_steps.py:71

  @negative @validation
  Scenario: Login fails with invalid email format                    # features/auth/login.feature:43
    Given the API is available                                       # steps/common_steps.py:16
