Feature: Unauthorized Access (401) # features/errors/unauthorized.feature:2
  As the system
  I want to reject unauthenticated requests
  So that protected resources remain secure
  @errors @security
  Feature: Unauthorized Access (401)  # features/errors/unauthorized.feature:2

  @auth
  Scenario Outline: Protected auth endpoints require authentication -- @1.1   # features/errors/unauthorized.feature:19
    Given the API is available                                                # steps/common_steps.py:16
    And I am not authenticated                                                # steps/common_steps.py:26
    When I make a GET request to "/auth/me"                                   # steps/common_steps.py:163
    Then the response status should be 401                                    # steps/common_steps.py:63
